Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:00.94,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,118)\fad(200,0)}“Claude picks GitHub Actions
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:00.94,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,190)\fad(200,0)}97% of the time, so we
Dialogue: 2,0:00:00.20,0:01:00.94,Hook,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(540,262)\fad(200,0)}started there”
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.05,0:00:00.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,I think that's a good
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.93,0:00:02.11,Caption,,0,0,0,,point because when we
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.11,0:00:03.39,Caption,,0,0,0,,were starting
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.39,0:00:04.71,Caption,,0,0,0,,we were thinking about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.71,0:00:05.31,Caption,,0,0,0,,DevOps, right
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.31,0:00:06.85,Caption,,0,0,0,,and then CI/CD.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.85,0:00:08.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,And someone put out this
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.21,0:00:09.13,Caption,,0,0,0,,report, what Claude
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.13,0:00:10.69,Caption,,0,0,0,,picks or what Claude
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.69,0:00:11.81,Caption,,0,0,0,,chooses. It was like a
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.81,0:00:13.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,report of all the dev
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:14.59,Caption,,0,0,0,,tools that Claude will
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:16.54,Caption,,0,0,0,,choose, given a specific
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.54,0:00:18.22,Caption,,0,0,0,,prompt. and GitHub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.22,0:00:20.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actions had like 97%
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.10,0:00:20.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,market share
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.72,0:00:22.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,so we were thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.46,0:00:22.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.82,0:00:24.56,Caption,,0,0,0,,the proper way to do CI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.56,0:00:25.94,Caption,,0,0,0,,you kind of have an
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,engine that does
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.02,0:00:27.80,Caption,,0,0,0,,aggressive caching and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:28.42,Caption,,0,0,0,,test selection
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.42,0:00:29.38,Caption,,0,0,0,,but, you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.38,0:00:30.10,Caption,,0,0,0,,we saw that and we were
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:30.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,like, okay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.72,0:00:32.02,Caption,,0,0,0,,well, clearly there's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.02,0:00:32.84,Caption,,0,0,0,,one place you should
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.84,0:00:33.64,Caption,,0,0,0,,start, which is GitHub
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.64,0:00:35.52,Caption,,0,0,0,,Actions, so I think even
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.52,0:00:36.58,Caption,,0,0,0,,if you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.58,0:00:37.44,Caption,,0,0,0,,if your product isn't
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.44,0:00:38.86,Caption,,0,0,0,,meant for agents because
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.86,0:00:40.00,Caption,,0,0,0,,of this whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.00,0:00:40.35,Caption,,0,0,0,,you know
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.30,0:00:41.72,Caption,,0,0,0,,the training is frozen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.72,0:00:43.68,Caption,,0,0,0,,and all the things that
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.68,0:00:44.46,Caption,,0,0,0,,are baked into the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.46,0:00:45.70,Caption,,0,0,0,,model, You're actually
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:46.76,Caption,,0,0,0,,building for humans and
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.76,0:00:47.82,Caption,,0,0,0,,agents at the same time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.82,0:00:49.18,Caption,,0,0,0,,so you kind of have to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.18,0:00:49.96,Caption,,0,0,0,,account for both.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:50.90,Caption,,0,0,0,,But yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.90,0:00:53.21,Caption,,0,0,0,,SEO is ultimately
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.21,0:00:54.47,Caption,,0,0,0,,is like basically the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.47,0:00:55.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,lagging indicator
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.41,0:00:56.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,right? Because if you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.23,0:00:57.01,Caption,,0,0,0,,have SEO
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:57.75,Caption,,0,0,0,,then you'll be in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.75,0:00:58.23,Caption,,0,0,0,,training set
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.23,0:00:58.97,Caption,,0,0,0,,and then you'll be
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.97,0:00:59.55,Caption,,0,0,0,,recommended
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.55,0:01:00.41,Caption,,0,0,0,,and it's just a loop
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.41,0:01:00.93,Caption,,0,0,0,,right?
